WEBVTT

00:03.720 --> 00:08.550
<i>To me, Charlotte was just a stranger 
I happened to come across.</i>

00:08.550 --> 00:09.730
<i>Until yesterday.</i>

00:10.060 --> 00:15.240
Charlotte, I'm going to give you a crash 
course on all things naughty in the world!

00:15.600 --> 00:16.530
I beg your pardon?

00:16.990 --> 00:19.170
The first naughty thing is...

00:24.880 --> 00:28.370
<i>I never expected her to be 
so ecstatic over cakes.</i>

00:32.930 --> 00:37.920
<i>She says she'll finish the cakes little by 
little since I preserved them with magic.</i>

00:39.060 --> 00:42.510
But simple food is too boring!

00:42.800 --> 00:44.160
I need more.

00:44.160 --> 00:48.520
I must give her more of what 
she's never experienced before.

00:51.210 --> 00:53.190
I know just the thing.

01:00.080 --> 01:04.660
<b>I'm Giving the Disgraced Noble Lady I
Rescued a Crash Course in Naughtiness</b>

02:28.250 --> 02:32.750
<b>Naughty Way to Release Stress</b>

02:33.630 --> 02:35.110
My goodness.

02:35.110 --> 02:36.760
When did I fall asleep?

02:39.880 --> 02:42.390
But I came up with so many great plans.

02:42.390 --> 02:44.770
It was worth spending time on it.

02:46.630 --> 02:51.450
This is the naughty list I compiled, 
after staying up all night!

02:52.170 --> 02:55.660
It's the clever scheme my 
genius brain has created!

02:55.660 --> 02:58.270
I'm sure Charlotte will be overjoyed!

02:59.320 --> 03:04.410
Summon lots of fluffy monsters and pet them to heart's content

02:59.450 --> 03:04.450
Create magic equipment using a lot of rare and precious materials

03:00.150 --> 03:04.160
Shove all the fools who oppose me into the full course of living hell

03:00.860 --> 03:04.780
Push on the dominos still in progress with magic and let them fall

03:02.390 --> 03:04.780
Write an epoch-making magical theory

03:02.700 --> 03:04.780
Construct a ginormous sandcastle
in a sand box using magic

03:04.780 --> 03:06.920
Wh-What are these?!

03:07.800 --> 03:10.410
I'd be the only one who'd 
be happy with these plans.

03:10.410 --> 03:12.050
I'd better create some more...

03:17.030 --> 03:19.320
Good morning, Allen.

03:19.320 --> 03:20.800
You're up early.

03:20.800 --> 03:23.680
Yes, I fell asleep in the study...

03:23.920 --> 03:27.220
<i>I better keep quiet about the notebook 
I stayed up all night making!</i>

03:27.220 --> 03:31.010
Allen, did you not sleep 
last night because of work?

03:31.920 --> 03:34.520
I saw you yawning earlier.

03:34.520 --> 03:36.310
It's bad for your health.

03:36.310 --> 03:40.310
R-Right, so I'm going to bed now.

03:40.310 --> 03:42.290
Please have breakfast without me.

03:42.290 --> 03:44.020
O-Of course.

03:44.480 --> 03:46.770
Should I wake you up for lunch?

03:46.770 --> 03:48.030
Please.

03:48.030 --> 03:50.000
By the way, what is that?

03:50.000 --> 03:51.320
Oh, it's a broom.

03:51.930 --> 03:54.570
I am going to clean up the entrance.

03:55.190 --> 03:59.250
<i>I guess I had a worn-out one here...</i>

03:59.250 --> 04:00.750
Was I not supposed to?

04:00.750 --> 04:03.830
Oh, it's not a problem.

04:04.220 --> 04:06.970
But you already cleaned the assigned places.

04:06.970 --> 04:09.080
I didn't ask you to do that much.

04:09.620 --> 04:14.860
Since I'm in your debt, I thought 
I should make myself useful.

04:15.300 --> 04:16.610
<i>She is </i>so<i> diligent.</i>

04:17.000 --> 04:21.920
<i>Her eyes, the glow of her skin, her breathing, 
everything says she's healthy.</i>

04:21.920 --> 04:24.080
<i>I guess I can let her clean...</i>

04:26.600 --> 04:29.320
It's okay to take it easy in the morning.

04:30.350 --> 04:32.960
Yes, but I'm used to this routine.

04:33.480 --> 04:35.400
Oh, okay...

04:36.080 --> 04:40.630
Were you cleaning every day when 
you were at the Duke's mansion?

04:42.530 --> 04:44.770
<i>No matter how horrible, 
her family is nobility.</i>

04:45.350 --> 04:48.390
<i>They must have had countless servants.</i>

04:48.890 --> 04:54.740
<i>If they still made her clean, then the 
reason must be rather unpleasant.</i>

04:55.600 --> 04:57.640
<i>She was treated as less than a servant,</i>

04:57.640 --> 05:02.170
<i>not to mention exiled from the country 
for a crime she didn't commit...</i>

05:02.820 --> 05:06.030
<b>GRR</b>

05:03.080 --> 05:05.040
Oh, Allen?!

05:03.570 --> 05:06.030
<b>GRR</b>

05:04.320 --> 05:06.030
<b>GRR</b>

05:05.070 --> 05:06.030
<b>GRR</b>

05:06.020 --> 05:08.900
Um, sleep well!

05:08.900 --> 05:11.030
I'll try to clean quietly.

05:14.170 --> 05:17.030
She never speaks ill of others.

05:17.570 --> 05:23.500
Not a word of resentment about her family or 
the ex-fiancé of a prince, who framed her.

05:23.500 --> 05:28.440
If it were me, I would completely and 
thoroughly <i>crush</i> all of them to pieces...

05:32.330 --> 05:34.560
It's not that she doesn't resent them.

05:34.560 --> 05:37.560
She just doesn't see them as objects 
of resentment, I guess?

05:37.930 --> 05:42.340
Even though she has something to say, 
she hesitates to say it out loud...

05:42.340 --> 05:44.000
That's what it felt like.

05:44.590 --> 05:50.570
What lies at the bottom of it is probably 
her fear towards them and her low self-esteem.

05:52.670 --> 05:54.730
Good Mornin—

05:54.730 --> 05:56.910
Hello? Who do we have here, nya?

05:56.910 --> 05:58.080
Oh, um...

05:58.080 --> 05:59.070
Scramble!

05:59.590 --> 06:01.160
Hold on a minute!

06:03.340 --> 06:04.840
Allen?

06:08.820 --> 06:09.940
Pardon me.

06:09.940 --> 06:12.010
This is a new maid I hired recently.

06:12.010 --> 06:13.390
She's a rather shy—

06:13.390 --> 06:14.640
Nice to meet you!

06:14.640 --> 06:17.060
Our motto's "Speedy, Safe, and Super cute"!

06:17.060 --> 06:20.110
I'm Miacha, a courier with 
Satyros Shipping Company, nya!

06:22.020 --> 06:25.740
She delivers my mail.

06:26.160 --> 06:28.110
Oh, um...

06:28.110 --> 06:30.820
N-Nice to meet you.

06:30.820 --> 06:35.780
Well, I didn't realize you were resourceful 
enough to hire a maid, Demon Lord.

06:35.780 --> 06:36.960
D-Demon Lord?!

06:38.650 --> 06:40.110
It's just my nickname.

06:40.110 --> 06:41.820
How disrespectful.

06:41.820 --> 06:46.940
Demon Lord, your maid 
looks somehow familiar...

06:47.380 --> 06:50.380
More precisely, in the recent paper...

06:53.180 --> 06:54.810
<i>That reaction!</i>

06:55.370 --> 06:57.690
<i>It's as good as admitting it.</i>

06:57.690 --> 07:00.140
<i>Let's try and smooth things over...</i>

07:00.140 --> 07:01.650
<i>If need be, I would—</i>

07:01.900 --> 07:04.400
Miacha, I can explain.

07:04.400 --> 07:06.770
Demon Lord, there's nothing 
to worry about, nya!

07:06.770 --> 07:10.400
At Satyros Shipping Company, the 
customers' needs comes first, nya!

07:10.710 --> 07:15.920
So it's none of my business who the maid 
at one of our customers' homes is!

07:17.180 --> 07:18.410
I appreciate it.

07:18.410 --> 07:20.920
I have no idea what you mean, nya.

07:21.970 --> 07:24.380
Th-Thank you.

07:25.570 --> 07:27.390
Don't mention it, nya!

07:27.390 --> 07:31.660
Neruz Kingdom is outside 
of our service area, nya!

07:32.180 --> 07:34.430
What if it were within your service area?

07:34.430 --> 07:35.990
Hmm...

07:35.210 --> 07:36.420
What's that face?

07:36.420 --> 07:38.680
Who knows?

07:36.680 --> 07:41.440
<b>Nya-ha</b>

07:36.680 --> 07:41.440
<b>Nya-ha</b>

07:38.680 --> 07:40.800
<i>This reaction says it could 
have gone south...?!</i>

07:41.820 --> 07:44.630
Here's your delivery for today, nya!

07:44.630 --> 07:47.550
Miacha, can I ask you to take a package?

07:47.550 --> 07:49.070
Of course, nya!

07:49.070 --> 07:51.050
What's that?

07:51.050 --> 07:53.560
It's the potion I deliver 
to the magic store in town.

07:54.060 --> 07:56.070
Please be careful not to break the bottles.

07:56.070 --> 07:58.070
Of course, nya!

07:58.070 --> 08:02.080
Your potion is in high demand 
because it's excellent!

08:02.080 --> 08:06.060
Allen, I didn't know that you make 
a living by selling potions...

08:06.060 --> 08:08.480
Why won't you live in town, nya?

08:08.480 --> 08:11.610
It'd be easier to make money that way.

08:12.330 --> 08:13.350
There are people...

08:14.900 --> 08:18.110
There are too many people in the city.

08:19.230 --> 08:21.760
You still don't like being 
around people, nya?

08:21.760 --> 08:24.610
You're young, so you've 
got to live a little!

08:24.610 --> 08:26.110
That's none of your business!

08:27.130 --> 08:31.900
I-It's because your face looks so scary
that people in town call you Demon Lord!

08:31.900 --> 08:32.960
Say <i>what</i>?!

08:34.520 --> 08:39.660
Well, I guess it's only natural people 
talk about an evil-looking sorcerer

08:39.660 --> 08:41.700
living on the outskirts of the city...

08:42.430 --> 08:44.230
It's up ahead, right?

08:44.230 --> 08:45.620
The lair of the Demon Lord?

08:45.620 --> 08:49.210
Yeah, he lives in the woods.

08:49.210 --> 08:52.110
I hear he casts a spell on 
anyone who approaches his house

08:52.110 --> 08:54.640
and turns them into puppets.

08:54.640 --> 08:59.570
I bet there's lots of puppets
displayed in his lair!

08:59.570 --> 09:00.430
Exactly!

09:00.430 --> 09:02.010
L-Let's not do this.

09:02.010 --> 09:04.900
We're forbidden to go into 
the woods alone anyhow...

09:04.900 --> 09:07.990
Don't be a chicken. Let's go!

09:06.340 --> 09:08.750
Y-Yeah, don't be a chicken...

09:07.990 --> 09:10.660
I'll defeat the Demon Lord myself!

09:10.940 --> 09:11.900
Hey, brats.

09:13.400 --> 09:15.910
It's not very safe around 
here, so be caref—

09:16.530 --> 09:18.560
Ah! It's the Demon Lord!

09:20.650 --> 09:25.260
Because of my unsettling nickname, 
kids come here as a test of courage.

09:25.260 --> 09:28.040
I'm just living my life quietly over here...

09:28.040 --> 09:31.650
So, "Demon Lord" really 
is just your nickname...

09:31.650 --> 09:33.060
Of course it is.

09:33.060 --> 09:35.270
I'm just a simple sorcerer.

09:35.680 --> 09:40.090
You hate people, but you can't 
abandon those in need...

09:40.090 --> 09:43.300
"Anti-social Mr. Nice Guy" 
is too complicated, nya.

09:43.300 --> 09:47.310
It's high time you find hobbies 
or a purpose for living, nya.

09:47.580 --> 09:49.810
I said that's none of your business...

09:52.000 --> 09:57.040
Listen, Miacha. I believe your company 
also handles mail order business, right?

09:57.040 --> 09:58.310
That's right, nya!

09:58.680 --> 10:04.500
We carry daily necessities, but I can get
a hold of anything if you request it!

10:05.280 --> 10:07.830
Here are the catalogues!

10:07.830 --> 10:09.830
You're reliable as ever.

10:09.830 --> 10:11.180
Let's see...

10:11.180 --> 10:13.210
Hmm, I see.

10:13.210 --> 10:14.280
This is perfect.

10:15.480 --> 10:17.110
Here, Charlotte.

10:17.110 --> 10:18.090
Y-Yes?

10:18.540 --> 10:21.840
I think I bought most of 
the daily necessities yesterday,

10:21.840 --> 10:24.910
but make a list of whatever 
else you may need from there.

10:24.910 --> 10:26.110
I'll place an order.

10:26.110 --> 10:29.800
I don't know what ladies might need.

10:29.800 --> 10:30.680
Yes.

10:31.800 --> 10:33.980
Is that all?

10:33.980 --> 10:36.730
Yes! Thank you very much.

10:33.980 --> 10:36.740
<b>EXCITED</b>

10:33.980 --> 10:36.740
<b>EXCITED</b>

10:33.980 --> 10:36.740
<b>EXCITED</b>

10:33.980 --> 10:36.740
<b>EXCITED</b>

10:33.980 --> 10:36.740
<b>EXCITED</b>

10:33.980 --> 10:36.740
<b>EXCITED</b>

10:37.110 --> 10:40.010
Allen, I will pay you back.

10:40.010 --> 10:42.450
No, there's no need. Don't worry.

10:42.450 --> 10:44.730
What?! No, I couldn't impose on you!

10:44.730 --> 10:47.490
You bought me cakes last night, and...

10:47.490 --> 10:48.500
It's fine.

10:48.960 --> 10:50.730
Just order whatever you want.

10:50.730 --> 10:52.750
If I detect a hint of hesitation...

10:52.750 --> 10:54.000
What then?

10:54.000 --> 10:58.550
I will buy <i>every</i> single 
item in this catalogue.

10:58.550 --> 11:00.760
Why do you have to be so extreme?!

11:01.030 --> 11:03.950
You'd better choose what 
you want, you hear me?

11:03.950 --> 11:06.200
O-Okay, I will!

11:09.270 --> 11:10.680
Miacha...?

11:10.680 --> 11:13.480
Ms. Maid, you have it rough, nya.

11:13.480 --> 11:17.770
If you want to stop the tyranny of the 
Demon Lord, you gotta tell him off, nya!

11:17.770 --> 11:22.300
N-No, I'm in his debt, so 
I couldn't possibly...

11:22.300 --> 11:24.480
No?! If it were me...

11:24.480 --> 11:29.280
I'd give him a taste of my killer cat-punch 
for his arrogant attitude, nya!

11:29.280 --> 11:30.810
Listen.

11:30.810 --> 11:34.970
This is the best way to forget bad 
things and release stress-nya.

11:34.970 --> 11:37.940
What a way to talk about 
your loyal customer...

11:37.940 --> 11:39.050
Miacha!

11:39.290 --> 11:40.040
That's it!

11:48.700 --> 11:53.700
<i>This is how I determined the next 
naughty thing to teach Charlotte.</i>

11:53.980 --> 11:59.990
<b>I'm Giving the Disgraced Noble Lady I
Rescued a Crash Course in Naughtiness</b>

12:00.990 --> 12:04.000
I've come to deliver your order, nya!

12:06.280 --> 12:09.740
These are the items Lottie ordered, nya!

12:09.740 --> 12:11.760
Very good, thank you.

12:12.080 --> 12:14.510
Th-Thank you very much!

12:15.750 --> 12:19.160
I'm certain you will like it, Lottie, nya!

12:19.160 --> 12:21.070
Please put it to good use, nya!

12:19.520 --> 12:21.270
<i>That's what she calls Charlotte now?</i>

12:21.070 --> 12:21.760
I will.

12:21.600 --> 12:24.170
<i>Looks like Miacha is 
totally attached to her.</i>

12:24.170 --> 12:27.270
And here is the item you 
ordered, Demon Lord!

12:29.190 --> 12:30.640
What is this?

12:31.640 --> 12:34.150
Hm, I can see it's a quality item.

12:36.650 --> 12:41.260
Anyhow, what are you planning 
to do with this, Demon Lord?

12:41.260 --> 12:42.950
Use it, obviously.

12:42.950 --> 12:45.890
What?! But you don't seem like the active type.

12:45.890 --> 12:48.160
No, no, not me.

12:49.150 --> 12:51.020
It's for Charlotte.

12:51.020 --> 12:52.810
Wait, me?!

12:52.810 --> 12:56.910
Wow, Lottie is more active than she looks!

12:56.910 --> 13:00.170
Wh-What exactly did you buy?

13:02.400 --> 13:03.940
Behold.

13:03.940 --> 13:06.370
I have prepared something 
I'm sure you'll love!

13:12.090 --> 13:12.910
What do you think?

13:12.910 --> 13:14.690
U-Um... what's this?

13:14.690 --> 13:16.440
That's a punching sand bag, nya!

13:16.440 --> 13:20.970
It's sports equipment used for boxing 
practice and exercises, nya!

13:22.710 --> 13:25.350
Wait, um, please hold on!

13:25.350 --> 13:28.210
Wh-Why should I be the one to use this?

13:28.210 --> 13:31.200
Oh, maybe it's for physical exercise...?

13:31.200 --> 13:33.070
Close, but not quite.

13:33.950 --> 13:36.710
This is today's naughty thing!

13:36.710 --> 13:38.960
N-Naughty thing...

13:39.230 --> 13:40.330
That's right.

13:41.490 --> 13:43.650
Why's he trying to look cool?

13:44.040 --> 13:45.950
What do you mean by "naughty thing," nya?

13:45.950 --> 13:47.830
Is it a kind of play?

13:47.830 --> 13:49.860
P-Play?

13:49.860 --> 13:52.440
Demon Lord, that's terrible, nya!

13:52.440 --> 13:54.910
With such an innocent and sweet girl...

13:54.910 --> 13:56.480
What are you imagining?!

13:56.480 --> 13:57.900
I won't do anything dangerous!

14:01.960 --> 14:03.230
You're all set.

14:03.230 --> 14:06.090
Now it's time to release your stress!

14:06.090 --> 14:08.340
Punch this as <i>hard</i> as you can!

14:08.730 --> 14:10.730
Th-This is...

14:10.730 --> 14:11.930
My...

14:11.930 --> 14:14.490
Yes, your "former" fiancé.

14:18.730 --> 14:22.110
What you need isn't to accept everything.

14:22.110 --> 14:23.370
It's to be angry.

14:23.370 --> 14:25.280
To be angry?

14:25.280 --> 14:26.250
That's right.

14:26.570 --> 14:31.160
Sometimes being patient is necessary, but 
it is just as necessary to let yourself go.

14:31.160 --> 14:33.760
Otherwise, you will eventually fall apart.

14:34.240 --> 14:37.220
<i>The emotions you ignore won't disappear.</i>

14:37.220 --> 14:39.490
<i>They lurk in the bottom of your heart,</i>

14:39.490 --> 14:41.780
<i>and eventually 
overflow to destroy you.</i>

14:42.140 --> 14:44.770
<i>I don't want Charlotte to go through that.</i>

14:45.250 --> 14:50.150
Well, anyone would hesitate if 
they were told to hit something.

14:50.150 --> 14:52.690
But soon enough, it becomes addictive...

14:53.690 --> 14:57.040
Why do you have to phrase 
it like a villain?!

14:57.370 --> 15:01.220
B-But I'm not angry...

15:01.220 --> 15:05.550
To find that photo, I looked 
through many newspapers.

15:06.010 --> 15:10.090
I learned how you were treated 
as a villain in Neruz Kingdom,

15:10.090 --> 15:11.560
and it frustrated me.

15:11.880 --> 15:14.940
They took everything from you, 
they trampled on your dignity,

15:14.940 --> 15:17.560
and you no longer have a place 
to stay in that country.

15:17.560 --> 15:19.740
How are you <i>not</i> angry?

15:19.740 --> 15:24.320
I'm sure the prince had a good reason.

15:24.320 --> 15:29.380
If there was a good reason, then it's 
okay to toss you away like a rag?

15:29.380 --> 15:32.500
You'll forgive their horrible 
behavior towards you?

15:32.500 --> 15:35.320
Demon Lord, perhaps that's 
overstepping a little...

15:35.570 --> 15:37.090
It can't be helped.

15:37.090 --> 15:41.240
I owe my family for raising me until now.

15:41.240 --> 15:47.310
And I feel bad for the prince for 
having someone like me as a fiancée.

15:48.500 --> 15:50.580
I can't resent them...

15:52.440 --> 15:55.660
<i>It looks like the root 
of the problem is rather deep.</i>

15:55.660 --> 15:59.500
<i>Agh! Why?! My plan should have been perfect!</i>

16:00.220 --> 16:05.980
<i>Here's the plan I came up with: 
First, let Charlotte realize her resentment.</i>

16:02.480 --> 16:07.300
Let Charlotte realize
her resentment

16:03.020 --> 16:07.140
<b>GRRR</b>

16:05.980 --> 16:07.320
I can't forgive him!

16:07.480 --> 16:14.310
Storm into the Neruz
Kingdom and uncover
the prince's evil deeds

16:07.910 --> 16:11.940
<i>Second, storm into the Neruz Kingdom and 
uncover the prince's evil deeds.</i>

16:11.940 --> 16:14.380
H-How did you know?!

16:14.490 --> 16:20.320
Charlotte proves her
innocence, and the
bad guys are captured

16:14.780 --> 16:19.150
<i>Third, Charlotte proves her innocence, 
and the bad guys are captured.</i>

16:19.150 --> 16:20.570
You'll pay for this!

16:20.500 --> 16:26.130
All problems are
solved, and she lives
happily ever after

16:21.100 --> 16:24.120
<i>Fourth, all problems are solved, 
and she lives happily ever after.</i>

16:24.120 --> 16:26.120
We did it, Allen!

16:26.640 --> 16:30.890
<i>But this won't be enough 
to heal Charlotte's heart.</i>

16:31.370 --> 16:34.640
<i>She hasn't faced her feelings yet.</i>

16:34.640 --> 16:37.880
<i>She's gotten too used to suppressing them.</i>

16:38.580 --> 16:45.220
<i>At this rate, even if the prince is 
condemned, she'll probably blame herself for it.</i>

16:45.630 --> 16:47.650
Excuse me, Demon Lord...?

16:48.250 --> 16:54.150
I don't think it's classy of me to stick my 
nose into other people's family business,

16:54.150 --> 16:58.320
but I believe you should leave 
it alone for a little bit, nya.

16:58.320 --> 17:00.530
I agree with you there, more or less.

17:00.530 --> 17:01.650
More or less?

17:01.970 --> 17:04.160
<i>Charlotte's wound is deep.</i>

17:04.510 --> 17:09.290
<i>But it's not in my nature to 
wait and let time heal it!</i>

17:10.110 --> 17:11.140
Charlotte.

17:11.140 --> 17:12.420
Y-Yes...?

17:14.330 --> 17:19.430
Instead of the sand bag... instead 
of the sand bag, you should hit me!

17:20.160 --> 17:21.190
I beg your pardon?

17:24.680 --> 17:26.410
You didn't hear me?

17:26.410 --> 17:28.680
I told you to hit me.

17:28.680 --> 17:31.310
Well, I heard you loud and clear, but...

17:28.690 --> 17:31.320
<b>PANICKY</b>

17:28.690 --> 17:31.320
<b>PANICKY</b>

17:31.550 --> 17:35.310
Demon Lord, I didn't know you 
were into <i>that</i> as well, nya!

17:35.730 --> 17:37.100
Don't get me wrong.

17:37.100 --> 17:39.590
This is one of the naughty things.

17:39.860 --> 17:41.400
Come on, Charlotte.

17:41.400 --> 17:43.010
Just hit me as hard as you can—

17:43.010 --> 17:44.840
I-I could never do such a thing!

17:45.130 --> 17:46.440
Charlotte...

17:46.440 --> 17:49.150
I owe you so much, Allen.

17:49.150 --> 17:50.340
The idea of hitting you is just—

17:50.630 --> 17:52.600
It's not a matter of <i>if</i> you can do it.

17:53.730 --> 17:55.080
You <i>will</i> do it.

18:16.770 --> 18:19.390
A-Allen?!

18:20.240 --> 18:22.760
Wh-What was that just now?!

18:22.760 --> 18:25.080
My glove moved on its own...

18:25.080 --> 18:26.280
It's my magic.

18:27.270 --> 18:31.510
I manipulated your right arm to hit me.

18:31.840 --> 18:35.490
I tried to reproduce the corkscrew 
punch of a professional boxer.

18:35.740 --> 18:38.480
Charlotte, that was a good punch.

18:38.940 --> 18:42.520
What am I being made to watch, nya?!

18:42.520 --> 18:45.070
Blood?! You're bleeding!

18:46.680 --> 18:48.560
It's not a big deal.

18:49.360 --> 18:51.000
Listen, Charlotte.

18:51.000 --> 18:52.500
I want you to know this.

18:52.500 --> 18:54.020
Y-Yes?

18:54.300 --> 18:59.530
No matter how much you punch me, 
step on me, curse and call me names...

18:59.850 --> 19:02.900
Whatever happens, I will never abandon you.

19:03.850 --> 19:05.890
I'm on your side, Charlotte.

19:07.050 --> 19:09.300
This isn't the household you used to live in.

19:09.300 --> 19:12.550
You're allowed to feel 
anything and say anything.

19:12.940 --> 19:14.670
You are free.

19:15.050 --> 19:16.520
Free...?

19:18.220 --> 19:21.830
Did you make me punch you 
just to tell me that?!

19:21.830 --> 19:23.670
Of course I did.

19:23.670 --> 19:26.550
You wouldn't change your mind 
if I didn't go this far.

19:26.810 --> 19:28.000
Still...

19:28.320 --> 19:31.320
I can't believe you'd resort 
to such a desperate act!

19:31.310 --> 19:36.820
<b>TREMBLE</b>

19:31.310 --> 19:36.820
<b>TREMBLE</b>

19:31.310 --> 19:36.820
<b>TREMBLE</b>

19:32.980 --> 19:34.250
<i>Look at that.</i>

19:34.250 --> 19:36.810
<i>She can be angry when she wants to.</i>

19:36.810 --> 19:41.820
Y-You may think that, but an injury of 
this level can be healed right away.

19:41.820 --> 19:43.930
Here, watch.

19:47.190 --> 19:49.730
There's nothing that cannot be undone.

19:49.730 --> 19:53.710
So I want you to be unafraid 
of anything and everything.

19:53.710 --> 19:54.970
Allen...

19:55.690 --> 19:56.830
However!

19:57.340 --> 20:00.660
It doesn't change the fact 
that you got hurt, does it?!

20:00.660 --> 20:03.340
Um, well, that is true...

20:03.340 --> 20:06.090
What is this conversation...?

20:06.510 --> 20:10.260
Please don't do anything 
like this ever again.

20:10.260 --> 20:12.600
My poor heart can't take it!

20:17.600 --> 20:19.160
O-Okay!

20:19.850 --> 20:21.100
I promise.

20:23.280 --> 20:27.780
I've been living my life, being 
afraid of a lot of things.

20:27.780 --> 20:29.110
But not anymore, right?

20:29.390 --> 20:30.460
That's right.

20:31.110 --> 20:33.430
I will try my best!

20:33.430 --> 20:39.890
It may not come right away, but I want to 
be able to say what I'm thinking out loud!

20:40.510 --> 20:42.880
Right. There's no need to rush.

20:43.150 --> 20:45.600
I'll be by your side no 
matter how long it takes.

20:47.930 --> 20:53.030
<i>It's wildly different from the initial plan, 
but Charlotte can now make a fresh start.</i>

20:53.630 --> 20:55.900
<i>I will watch over her.</i>

20:55.900 --> 20:59.400
What a nice story, nya...

20:59.800 --> 21:01.900
Miacha, I'm sorry.

21:01.900 --> 21:03.910
I made you deliver this...

21:04.600 --> 21:07.660
But looks like it might be a while 
until there's a need for it.

21:07.660 --> 21:10.320
Oh no, please don't mention it, nya!

21:10.320 --> 21:14.660
I would appreciate your continued 
patronage at Satyros Shipping Company though!

21:15.150 --> 21:16.790
Yes, of course that's my plan.

21:16.790 --> 21:17.660
Why do you ask?

21:17.660 --> 21:22.420
I mean... I'm sure you'd be in need of 
all sorts of items in the future, nya!

21:22.870 --> 21:27.150
A double bed, rings, and soon 
you'll need baby stuff, nya.

21:27.150 --> 21:29.930
It's my time to shine as a courier, nya!

21:31.570 --> 21:33.820
Why would I need stuff like that...?

21:33.820 --> 21:34.700
I don't know.

21:40.740 --> 21:43.450
Let's see, what else...?

21:53.570 --> 21:55.770
I found you.

21:55.770 --> 21:57.900
You're not getting away anymore...

23:30.560 --> 23:33.380
What kind of naughty thing 
will they do next?

23:33.380 --> 23:36.280
I hope you're not imagining 
something inappropriate.

23:35.640 --> 23:40.010
<b>Next Episode</b>

23:35.640 --> 23:40.010
<b>Naughty Show Down</b>

23:36.280 --> 23:37.750
Next episode, "Naughty Show Down."

23:37.750 --> 23:39.910
There's a lot to look forward to, nya!
